## Changed

- Split polling into a replaceable Schedule-driven deadline fiber and a separate scoped poll-sampling worker. Replacing a deadline now interrupts only its wait, never an active sample.
- Kept successful navigation as authoritative work: `next`/`previous` increment the stale-sample authority and reset polling without inventing a track projection.
- Added deterministic `TestClock` coverage proving a playing state samples again at the three-second deadline; the fake provider now records sample calls.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/provider.ts`, `packages/music-core/tests/session-coordinator.test.ts`.

